  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An eyeshadow that sweeps on seamlessly and diffuses instantly for a suede-like veil of dimension that lasts up to 16 hours—it’s eyeshadow, simplified.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Jojoba Esters: Create a nourishing layer on skin to help with longer wear.<br>- Ceramides and Active Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and retain moisture.<br>- Squalane and Natural Silica: Help with blendability, glide, and playtime.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Even without primer, SuperSuede Eyeshadow wears all day without creasing, smudging, fading, or patchiness. In modern neutral shades with demi-matte and low-lit shimmer finishes, wear one shade alone or layer multipl</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe across the eyelid using the large end of The Double Eyeshadow Brush (sold separately) for a soft wash of color.<br>-Blend upward toward the crease until the edges fade seamlessly for natural-looking shape and depth.<br>-Define by using the small end of The Double-Ended Eyeshadow Brush, focusing color along the lash line.<br>-Saie's Artistry Tip: SuperSuede Eyeshadow is customizable. Wear one shade alone or stack with another for added dimension.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Jojoba Esters: Create a nourishing layer on skin to help with longer wear.<br>-Ceramides and Active Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and retain moisture.<br>-Squalane and Natural Silica: Help with blendability, glide, and playtime.<br><br>Mica, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Kaolin, Silica, Squalane, Hectorite, Octyldodecanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Jojoba Esters, Alumina, Potassium Sorbate, Boron Nitride, Cellulose, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Ceramide Np, Tocopherol [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163), Ultramarines (Ci 77007), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
